WOLips
------

eogen's model, .eogen parser and generator are extracted from WOLips
(https://github.com/wocommunity/wolips), the WebObjects plug-in for
Eclipse, at commit a325dd3e (2026-09-30). These packages and files in
eogen-core come from it:

  eogen (net.logicsquad.eogen.)  WOLips (org.objectstyle.wolips.)
  -----------------------------  ---------------------------------------
  model                          eomodeler.core.model
  model.qualifier                eomodeler.core.model.qualifier
  model.history                  eomodeler.core.model.history
  kvc                            eomodeler.core.kvc
  utils                          eomodeler.core.utils, and
                                 ComparisonUtils, StringUtils and
                                 URLUtils from baseforplugins.util
  Messages, messages.properties  eomodeler.core
  generator                      EOGeneratorModel, CommandLineTokenizer,
                                 EOModelReference, PathUtils and
                                 EOGeneratorResourceLoader from
                                 eogenerator.core.model, and
                                 VelocityEOGeneratorRunner from
                                 eogenerator.core.runner
  velocity.WOLipsVelocityUtils   thirdparty.velocity
  templates (resources)          eogenerator.core's templates folder

They are distributed under the ObjectStyle Group Software License,
Version 1.0, below. Each Java file keeps the licence header it had in
WOLips. Files that had no header there have been given WOLips's
standard header, because WOLips distributes them under the same
licence. The templates carry no notice, in WOLips or here: a notice in
a template would be copied into every file generated from it.

Logic Squad has changed these files to remove their dependencies on
Eclipse, OSGi and Velocity 1. The git history records every change,
starting from an unmodified copy of the upstream files.


